     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Try something like:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">t </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">call</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>But if the column of read.table is not numeric, it&#39;s likely there is an issue with the file, containing non-numeric values.<br></div>"
